3
00:00:11.336 --> 00:00:15.736
"Oh dear!" Mayor Bloom put a hand on the wall to brace himself.

4
00:00:15.737 --> 00:00:18.359
After a couple of seconds, the shaking stopped.

5
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:22.732
The mayor hurried into his office and picked up the phone.

6
